<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT QUEENSLAND 35-24 IN SUPER 12.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT QUEENSLAND 35-24 IN SUPER 12.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, (South Africa 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Free State</p>
<p>beat Queensland 35-24 (halftime 26-10) in their Super 12 rugby</p>
<p>match at the Free State Stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Free State - Tries: Werne Swanepoel, Charl van Rensberg,</p>
<p>Jan-Harm van Wyk. Conversion: Jannie de Beer. Penalties: de Beer</p>
<p>(5). Drop goal: de Beer.</p>
<p>Queensland - Tries: Dan Crowley, Shane Drahm, Jason Little.</p>
<p>Conversions: John Eales (3). Drop Goal: Shane Drahm</p>
</text>
